-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">DRAGON SHROUD TECHNIQUE</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Cost: 3+m, 1wp; Mins: Stealth 5, Essence 3; </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Type: Simple</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Keywords:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Duration: One scene</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Prerequisite Charms: Soundless Action Prana, Wind-Walking Technique</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">No Change</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4915-darkuwa","name":"Darkuwa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4915_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T12:58:56-08:00","id":817874,"title":"","content":"Thrown<br /> <br /> LOYAL WEAPON<br /> Cost: 1m; Mins: Thrown 4, Essence 1;<br /> Type: Supplemental<br /> Keywords: Dual<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Prerequisite Charms: None<br /> Remove &quot;Thrown weapons still attack with their normal Speed, however, and the weapon will not be available for any reflexive uses between the ticks upon which the Dragon-Blooded normally acts.&quot;<br /> <br /> PERSISTENT HORNET ATTACK<br /> Cost: 3m; Mins: Thrown 4, Essence 1;<br /> Type: Simple<br /> Keywords: Withering Only<br /> Duration: (Essence) Turns<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Loyal Weapon<br /> The Exalt makes a normal ranged withering attack with a thrown weapon. For a number of turns after that equal to the Exalts Essence, the Exalt may make an additional Withering attack with the weapon. The weapon may be struck by others and has a Parry and Dodge DV equal to the Exalts Essence, if struck this charm immediately ends and the weapon drops to the ground. The Exalt may have only 1 instance of this charm active at once. Repurchases at 3 and 5 Essence increase the number of active uses of this charm the Exalt can have going at once.<br /> <br /> INVISIBLY HIDDEN CHAKRAM METHOD<br /> Cost: 10m per weapon, 1wp; Mins: Thrown 5, Essence 2;<br /> Type: Simple<br /> Keywords:<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Persistent Hornet Attack<br /> No Change<br /> <br /> WHIRLWIND SHIELD FORM<br /> Cost: 3m + 2m per ally protected; Mins: Thrown 4, Essence 1;<br /> Type: Simple<br /> Keywords:<br /> Duration: One scene<br /> Prerequisite Charms: None<br /> Allies within Short range affected by this charm add half the users Essence rounded up to their Parry DV.<br /> <br /> VENGEFUL GUST COUNTERATTACK<br /> Cost: 4m; Mins: Thrown 5, Essence 1;<br /> Type: Reflexive<br /> Keywords: Withering Only<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Whirlwind Shield Form<br /> If an ally protected by this charms prerequisite successfully Parries a Ranged attack, the Exalt may activate this charm to gain Essence/2 rounded up bonus non charm dice on her next attack, within Essence turns, against the person who attacked.<br /> <br /> DEADLY BLADES OF THE FIVE DRAGONS<br /> Cost: 5m per weapon; Mins: Thrown 5, Essence 2;<br /> Type: Simple<br /> Keywords: Elemental, Dual<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Persistent Hornet Attack, Vengeful Gust Counterattack<br /> Creates a weapon made of the Exalts Aspect that is immediately thrown, using the stats for an artifact thrown weapon of the Exalts choice.<br /> Air Aspects Do not need an aim action<br /> Fire Aspects gain +2 bonus damage<br /> Water Aspects force a -2 to soak or -1 to hardness<br /> Earth Aspects gain +1 to Overwhelming<br /> Wood Aspects gain +1 Accuracy<br /> ELEMENTAL ARMOR TECHNIQUE<br /> Cost: 2m per soak/hardness, 1 wp; Mins: Thrown 5, Essence 2;<br /> Type: Simple<br /> Keywords: Elemental<br /> Duration: One scene<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Vengeful Gust Counterattack<br /> Increases the Exalts natural soak and hardness by one per two motes spent to a maximum of the Exalts level of Thrown.<br /> Air Aspects: Increases these bonuses by half against ranged attacks<br /> Fire Aspects: Increases the damage done by her anima by 1<br /> Water Aspects: Reduces her onslaught penalties by half the soak/hardness granted<br /> Earth Aspects: Increases the difficulty of appropriate gambits(grapple, bull rush) against the Exalt by the soak/hardness granted<br /> Wood Aspects: Attackers gain one less initiative on withering attacks and reset to 1 less than normal initiative after a successful decisive attack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4915,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4915-darkuwa","user":"Darkuwa","date":". 01-27-2016, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4915-darkuwa","name":"Darkuwa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4915_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T12:59:59-08:00","id":817877,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Awareness</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">ALL-ENCOMPASSING EARTH SENSE</span>